{"id":"2d0b5355f34d1101","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-centered-family-poset.md","title":"ZFC Centered Family Poset","display":"df-zfc-centered-family-poset — ZFC Centered Family Poset","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-centered-family-poset","aliases":["58-df-zfc-centered-family-poset","58-df-zfc-forcing10-centered-poset"],"display":"df-zfc-centered-family-poset — ZFC Centered Family Poset","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-family]]","[[58-df-poset]]","[[58-df-finite]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-centered-family-poset"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-centered-family-poset</span><span>58-df-zfc-forcing10-centered-poset</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-centered-family-poset — ZFC Centered Family Poset"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"545b51e7aa011030\" href=\"?note=545b51e7aa011030\" title=\"58-df-family\">58-df-family</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"58-df-poset\">58-df-poset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"58-df-finite\">58-df-finite</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\in V\">\\(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\in V\\)</span> (ordered carrier and relation; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"58-df-poset\">58-df-poset</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A \\subseteq \\mathbb{P}\">\\(A \\subseteq \\mathbb{P}\\)</span> (centered family candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\)</span> (partial-order predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"58-df-poset\">58-df-poset</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}\\)</span> (finite-set predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CenteredFamilyPoset}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CenteredFamilyPoset}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing10CenteredPoset}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing10CenteredPoset}_S\\)</span> (alias predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}centered\\text{-}family\\text{-}poset} \\vdash \\mathrm{CenteredFamilyPoset}_S(A,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land A\\subseteq\\mathbb P\\land\\forall F\\subseteq A\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Finite}(F)\\to\\exists r\\in\\mathbb P\\;\\forall p\\in F\\;(\\langle r,p\\rangle\\in\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}centered\\text{-}family\\text{-}poset} \\vdash \\mathrm{CenteredFamilyPoset}_S(A,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land A\\subseteq\\mathbb P\\land\\forall F\\subseteq A\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Finite}(F)\\to\\exists r\\in\\mathbb P\\;\\forall p\\in F\\;(\\langle r,p\\rangle\\in\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}centered\\text{-}family\\text{-}poset} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing10CenteredPoset}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{CenteredFamilyPoset}_S(\\mathbb P,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}centered\\text{-}family\\text{-}poset} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing10CenteredPoset}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{CenteredFamilyPoset}_S(\\mathbb P,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A centered family is a subset whose every subfamily accepted by the registered finite-set predicate has a common lower bound.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-forcing10-centered-poset</code> is merged here.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-family","status":"resolved","id":"545b51e7aa011030","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-family]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-poset","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-poset]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-finite","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-finite]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-poset","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-5","tar